  "description": "A nun is a female member of a religious order, typically in a Christian denomination, who has taken vows of poverty, chastity, and obedience. The meme uses the nun as a contrast to the Muslim woman, implying that religious head coverings are only offensive or dangerous when worn by Muslims, not by Christians. This is a form of religious bias and misrepresentation.",
